# ─── C++ build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/build/
*.o
*.obj
*.exe

# ─── Node / frontend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── Algorithm result outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerable from the C++ optimizer; some exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit
# (e.g. output/ackley_result.json ~103 MB). A couple of small showcase PNGs
# are kept under docs/assets/ instead.
/output/

# ─── Source archives (extracted copies are what get tracked, not the archive) ──
# No .zip is tracked anywhere in this repo, so ignore them as a class rather
# than naming each one as it appears.
*.zip

# ─── dev-workflow working memory (never committed) ────────────────────────────
changes_version.md

# ─── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.log
